# Brand

- Studio name: **Photon Poetry** (not Photonectar on public pages).
- Products only: **Luminous**, **Shimmer**, **Best Units**. Do not invent additional products.
- Brand is **fresh and unformed** — keep visuals and voice provisional; do not invent a heavy identity system, fake history, or overconfident taglines.
- Logo sources live in `Branding/` (Affinity). Web assets are exported under `site/assets/` (`logo.svg`, `favicon.svg`). Never serve or link `.af` files from the site.
- **Reverse on dark:** if a logo sits on a dark background, always use the reverse mark (light / white ink, orange accent preserved). Today that is `site/assets/logo.svg`. Do not place a dark-ink mark on a dark field.
- **On light backgrounds:** use a dark-ink export (`site/assets/logo-on-light.svg` when first needed — export from Affinity; do not invent fills). Never put white ink on a light field.
- Accent from the mark: `#ffa400` / orange. Avoid generic AI landing tropes (purple gradients, cream+serif+terracotta clusters, glow-heavy dark UI).
- Shared contacts for now: `hello@photonpoetry.com`, `support@photonpoetry.com`.
